    {
      "id": "claim_d91fb3720183432ea9206e8e9c320402",
      "statement": "All six mutation helpers in `transitSelectionMutations.ts` route through one private `updateCommute` helper that spreads `selections.commutes` and replaces only the slot named by the `commute` argument, passing the sibling context through untouched by reference. There is no code path in the module that can reach the sibling context, which is the whole enforcement of DESIGN.md's success criterion 7 (the two contexts never modify each other and are stored independently) and its QA criterion that deleting on one side preserves the other.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://DESIGN.md#L36-L36",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7a276fa957b875bcf3b83072dd9f44098a9b69cc2df560fae820e88c1384a4ed:"
