    {
      "id": "claim_e493c0b4d0614537b630ad6f1319c295",
      "statement": "Subway mutations make the first of a newly added batch win: `addSubwayStationsToCommute` sets `selectedSubwayStationId` to `stations[0]?.id ?? previous`, so saving a new station immediately switches the watch to it. `selectSubwayStationForCommute` no-ops unless the id exists in the saved `subwayStations`, and `removeSubwayStationFromCommute` falls back to `subwayStations[0]?.id ?? null` only when the removed station was the selected one, preserving the selection otherwise.",
      "evidence": [
