      "id": "claim_495b9202379d436093127e57a783bb53",
      "statement": "Anonymous selections persist under the localStorage key `mota:transit-selections:v1`, and the storage abstraction is narrow enough (`Pick<Storage, \"getItem\" | \"setItem\">`) that tests substitute a stub rather than a full `Storage` implementation.",
